{"p01":{"img":{"src":"m_shanjing.jpg","cap":"马远《山径春行图》（南宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"五八三年，薛道衡奉命出使南边的陈朝。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p01-0-28b097c3.mp3","dur":3.56},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"正月初七，人日。他人在建康，心早已飞回了北方。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p01-1-f60acae9.mp3","dur":5.47}]},"p02":{"img":{"src":"xingshu.jpg","cap":"《明皇幸蜀图》（传李昭道，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"长安城外，王勃送朋友杜少府去蜀州上任。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p02-0-b2a0ada9.mp3","dur":3.93},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"别人送别都掉眼泪，他偏不。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p02-1-83cf8f49.mp3","dur":2.69}]},"p03":{"img":{"src":"m_fankuan.jpg","cap":"范宽《溪山行旅图》（北宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"骆宾王上书言事，得罪了权贵，被诬陷下狱。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p03-0-6d177a96.mp3","dur":3.92},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"秋天，狱墙外的老槐树上，蝉叫个不停。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p03-1-598359bc.mp3","dur":3.98}]},"p04":{"img":{"src":"m_fankuan.jpg","cap":"范宽《溪山行旅图》（北宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"六九六年，陈子昂随军北上幽州，屡次献策，没有人听。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p04-0-6c53ed9c.mp3","dur":5.36},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"他独自登上幽州台，四下一望。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p04-1-5fb814fb.mp3","dur":2.83}]},"p05":{"img":{"src":"m_shanjing.jpg","cap":"马远《山径春行图》（南宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"王维十七岁，一个人在长安闯荡。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p05-0-f6c60921.mp3","dur":2.88},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"又到九月九，重阳节。家乡的兄弟们，该去登高了。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p05-1-51896749.mp3","dur":5.29}]},"p06":{"img":{"src":"m_wenji.jpg","cap":"陈居中《文姬归汉图》（南宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"秦朝修的关，汉朝守的关，一千年过去，月亮还是那轮月亮。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p06-0-d6008c3c.mp3","dur":5.41},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"王昌龄站在边塞上，想起了汉朝的李广。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p06-1-803c8415.mp3","dur":3.91}]},"p07":{"img":{"src":"m_youchun.jpg","cap":"展子虔《游春图》（传，故宫博物院）","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"襄阳城外，鹿门山下，孟浩然过着隐居的日子。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p07-0-60ce2936.mp3","dur":4.2},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"昨夜下了一场雨，他睡到天大亮才醒。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p07-1-45b00b35.mp3","dur":3.25}]},"p08":{"img":{"src":"m_shangmei.jpg","cap":"马远《月下赏梅图》（南宋，大都会艺术博物馆）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"李白离开蜀中，一个人在外漂泊。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p08-0-9c1ccbe3.mp3","dur":3},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"客舍的夜里，睡不着，抬头看见了月亮。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p08-1-721201f8.mp3","dur":3.78}]},"p09":{"img":{"src":"cj_a.jpg","cap":"吴伟《长江万里图》卷（明）局部","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"蒲州城外，黄河边上，有一座鹳雀楼。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p09-0-fabb4676.mp3","dur":3.52},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"王之涣登上楼去，太阳正落向西边的山。","say":"王之涣登上楼去，太阳正洛向西边的山。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p09-1-f703d68b.mp3","dur":3.79}]},"p10":{"img":{"src":"m_wenji.jpg","cap":"陈居中《文姬归汉图》（南宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"玉门关外，就是茫茫大漠。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p10-0-60c517f9.mp3","dur":2.22},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"守边的士兵，吹起了羌笛。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p10-1-c3182a75.mp3","dur":2.43}]},"p12":{"img":{"src":"hhl.jpg","cap":"夏永《黄鹤楼图》（元）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七三零年春天，孟浩然要从黄鹤楼坐船，东下扬州。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p12-0-2e8ebece.mp3","dur":4.84},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"李白来送他，一直望着那片帆。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p12-1-ddb005fc.mp3","dur":2.86}]},"p13":{"img":{"src":"m_fankuan.jpg","cap":"范宽《溪山行旅图》（北宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"二十四岁的杜甫，考进士落了第，却一点也不灰心。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p13-0-2abf46ff.mp3","dur":4.3},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"他来到泰山脚下，抬头望去。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p13-1-51a2844c.mp3","dur":2.85}]},"p14":{"img":{"src":"m_shangmei.jpg","cap":"马远《月下赏梅图》（南宋，大都会艺术博物馆）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"开元名臣张九龄，被李林甫排挤，贬到了荆州。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p14-0-2fe31393.mp3","dur":4.26},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"又是一个月圆的夜晚，他想起了远方的人。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p14-1-72f23869.mp3","dur":3.64}]},"p15":{"img":{"src":"march.jpg","cap":"敦煌壁画《张议潮统军出行图》（唐）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"渭城，长安西边送别的地方。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p15-0-23668741.mp3","dur":2.49},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"清早下过一场小雨，王维摆酒，为出使安西的元二送行。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p15-1-21eba39a.mp3","dur":5.22}]},"p16":{"img":{"src":"m_shanjing.jpg","cap":"马远《山径春行图》（南宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七四四年，八十六岁的贺知章辞官，回到越州老家。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p16-0-6d1a3f07.mp3","dur":4.66},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"离家的时候，他还是个少年。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p16-1-dcf06e94.mp3","dur":2.52}]},"p17":{"img":{"src":"m_wenji.jpg","cap":"陈居中《文姬归汉图》（南宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"高适困在宋州，穷得很。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p17-0-1c829c42.mp3","dur":2.3},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"冬天，大雪，他送别同样落魄的琴师董庭兰。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p17-1-ee73caba.mp3","dur":4.36}]},"p18":{"img":{"src":"m_wenji.jpg","cap":"陈居中《文姬归汉图》（南宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"北庭，天山脚下，八月就下起了大雪。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p18-0-4398c554.mp3","dur":3.37},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"岑参在军营里摆酒，送武判官回京。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p18-1-ff4c15c7.mp3","dur":3.74}]},"p19":{"img":{"src":"cj_c.jpg","cap":"吴伟《长江万里图》卷（明）局部","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"安史之乱，张继逃到江南避难。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p19-0-e0ef75f2.mp3","dur":2.79},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"船停在苏州城外的枫桥，夜深了，他睡不着。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p19-1-8f6957ea.mp3","dur":4.12}]},"p20":{"img":{"src":"m_shangmei.jpg","cap":"马远《月下赏梅图》（南宋，大都会艺术博物馆）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七五七年，长安陷在叛军手里，杜甫也被困在城中。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p20-0-ea26b145.mp3","dur":4.56},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"妻子儿女，远在北边的羌村。今晚的月亮，她也在看吧。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p20-1-cd22d0fb.mp3","dur":5.97}]},"p22":{"img":{"src":"march.jpg","cap":"敦煌壁画《张议潮统军出行图》（唐）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七五九年，唐军在邺城大败，官府到处抓人补充兵员。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p22-0-d6f4d3a8.mp3","dur":4.98},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"杜甫赶路，天黑了，投宿在石壕村。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p22-1-ebb0e78f.mp3","dur":3.39}]},"p24":{"img":{"src":"spring.jpg","cap":"郭熙《早春图》（北宋，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七六一年，杜甫在成都草堂安了家，难得过上几天安稳日子。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p24-0-f26a6fcb.mp3","dur":5.22},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"这天夜里，下起了一场春雨。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p24-1-32001141.mp3","dur":2.65}]},"p25":{"img":{"src":"cj_a.jpg","cap":"吴伟《长江万里图》卷（明）局部","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七六三年正月，史朝义兵败自缢，安史之乱终于平定。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/p25-0-4d57c410.mp3","dur":4.69},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"消息传到梓州，杜甫哭了。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/p25-1-88cc057b.mp3","dur":2.56}]},"q01":{"img":{"src":"cj_b.jpg","cap":"吴伟《长江万里图》卷（明）局部","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"二十五岁的李白，仗剑出蜀。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q01-0-6c702243.mp3","dur":2.45},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"船出三峡，过了荆门，眼前忽然一片开阔。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q01-1-4c987dd8.mp3","dur":3.96}]},"q02":{"img":{"src":"libai_walk.jpg","cap":"梁楷《李白行吟图》（南宋，东京国立博物馆）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"李白在长安供奉翰林，不到两年，就被赐金放还。","say":"李白在长安供奉翰林，不到两年，就被赐金放环。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q02-0-ddc8a3ba.mp3","dur":4.28},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"朋友们为他摆酒，满桌好菜，他却吃不下。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q02-1-fa503441.mp3","dur":3.79}]},"q03":{"img":{"src":"libai.jpg","cap":"梁楷 李白像（南宋，想象画像）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七四五年秋天，李白和杜甫在鲁郡同游，一起喝酒，一起登山。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q03-0-06fb46e1.mp3","dur":5.77},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"石门分手，这一别，就再也没有见面。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q03-1-b1924bc3.mp3","dur":3.61}]},"q04":{"img":{"src":"dufu.jpg","cap":"杜甫像（后世想象画像）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"这一年秋天，杜甫和李白一起漂泊，求仙炼丹，一无所成。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q04-0-c1947a38.mp3","dur":5.05},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"杜甫看着这位老大哥，写了四句话。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q04-1-3d83d125.mp3","dur":3.22}]},"q05":{"img":{"src":"shitao.jpg","cap":"石涛《太白诗意山水图》轴（清）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"离开长安快十年了，李白漂泊到了宣城。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q05-0-bc0740e2.mp3","dur":3.42},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"他独自坐在敬亭山前，坐了很久。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q05-1-3f6aa2df.mp3","dur":3.1}]},"q06":{"img":{"src":"libai.jpg","cap":"梁楷 李白像（南宋，想象画像）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七六二年，李白病倒在当涂。","say":"七六二年，李白病倒在裆涂。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q06-0-28af1267.mp3","dur":2.59},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"他一生自比大鹏。最后一次，他写这只大鹏。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q06-1-a546e012.mp3","dur":4.58}]},"q07":{"img":{"src":"march.jpg","cap":"敦煌壁画《张议潮统军出行图》（唐）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"咸阳桥头，尘土飞扬。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q07-0-ebb494de.mp3","dur":2.24},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"又一批士兵要出征了，爹娘妻子哭着拉住他们的衣服。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q07-1-2f195546.mp3","dur":4.52}]},"q08":{"img":{"src":"m_guoguo.jpg","cap":"张萱《虢国夫人游春图》（宋摹本，辽宁省博物馆）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"huanghelou","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"三月三，上巳节，长安曲江边游人如织。","say":"三月三，上巳节，长安区江边游人如织。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q08-0-bf5f23fd.mp3","dur":3.6},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"杨贵妃的姐妹们来了，排场大得吓人。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q08-1-f989519a.mp3","dur":3.55}]},"q09":{"img":{"src":"xingshu.jpg","cap":"《明皇幸蜀图》（传李昭道，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七五五年冬天，杜甫从长安赶回奉先，看望家人。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q09-0-ad1b0956.mp3","dur":4.59},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"路过骊山，玄宗正在华清宫里欢宴。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q09-1-e427e3a3.mp3","dur":3.4}]},"q10":{"img":{"src":"m_shangmei.jpg","cap":"马远《月下赏梅图》（南宋，大都会艺术博物馆）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七五九年秋天，杜甫流落到秦州边城。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q10-0-9c92053b.mp3","dur":3.46},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"战乱未平，弟弟们各在一方，生死不知。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q10-1-f3747efe.mp3","dur":3.88}]},"q11":{"img":{"src":"m_zhuge.jpg","cap":"《诸葛亮像》（明，南薰殿旧藏）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"杜甫刚到成都，第一件事，就是去找诸葛亮的祠堂。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q11-0-4f09f037.mp3","dur":4.35},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"锦官城外，柏树森森。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q11-1-86f5fa29.mp3","dur":2.39}]},"q12":{"img":{"src":"dufu.jpg","cap":"杜甫像（后世想象画像）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"八月，秋风大作，把杜甫草堂的屋顶掀了。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q12-0-0bcd8f27.mp3","dur":3.63},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"夜里又下起了雨，屋里没有一处不漏。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q12-1-91f713d1.mp3","dur":2.96}]},"q13":{"img":{"src":"m_youchun.jpg","cap":"展子虔《游春图》（传，故宫博物院）","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"bgm":"baidi","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"避乱两年，杜甫终于回到了成都草堂。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q13-0-57438523.mp3","dur":3.3},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"推开窗，春光正好。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q13-1-43863c97.mp3","dur":2.06}]},"q14":{"img":{"src":"cj_c.jpg","cap":"吴伟《长江万里图》卷（明）局部","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七六七年重阳，五十六岁的杜甫在夔州，又老又病。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q14-0-0fead6c8.mp3","dur":4.68},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"他一个人，登上了高台。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q14-1-b0627c63.mp3","dur":2.17}]},"q15":{"img":{"src":"m_yueyang.jpg","cap":"夏永《岳阳楼图》（元）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":"chunwang","intro":[{"w":"narr","p":"缓","t":"七六八年，杜甫乘一叶孤舟出了三峡，来到岳阳。","pre":300,"src":"audio/intro/q15-0-c964d841.mp3","dur":4.54},{"w":"narr","p":"慢","t":"早就听说洞庭湖，今天终于登上了岳阳楼。","c":1,"src":"audio/intro/q15-1-7b4c37c9.mp3","dur":3.71}]},"q16":{"img":{"src":"m_gongle.jpg","cap":"《宫乐图》（唐，台北故宫）","lic":"Public domain"},"bgm":